{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Create your Visual Novel</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>NovelStudio</strong> is an all-in-one editor designed to bring your interactive stories to life. No technical skills required. Whether you're a writer, game designer, or simply passionate about storytelling, become a Visual Novel producer. Characters, backgrounds, dialogues, mechanics. Everything you need to express your creativity is included.\u00a0\u00a0<br><br>\u00a0 \u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Customizable 2D animated characters\u00a0\u00a0</strong>\u00a0\u00a0<br>Create your own characters in just a few clicks with a variety of facial expressions, outfits, and poses. You can also import your own artwork or custom 3D models.<br>\u00a0 \u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Design your own backgrounds\u00a0\u00a0</strong>\u00a0<br>Easily craft classic visual novel settings or import your own images for a more personal visual style.<br>\u00a0 \u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Build your story without coding\u00a0\u00a0</strong>\u00a0<br>Create your story\u2019s structure using an intuitive system of narrative blocks. Each block contains a scene with backgrounds, characters, dialogue, interactive choices, and audio files.<br>\u00a0 \u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Add gameplay and depth\u00a0\u00a0</strong>\u00a0<br>Use variables to create gauges, manage money, track relationships, or influence the story. Add modifiers to build complex systems, all without writing a single line of code. <br>\u00a0 \u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Create playable levels\u00a0\u00a0</strong>\u00a0<br>With its built-in 3D map editor, Novel Studio even lets you design interactive environments with playable characters and ready-to-use assets.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3908150?t=1767993599","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3908150/572b019b0a83d64aee1a98a620ed8c868dbdd404/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1767993599","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3908150/1b5c0793b9597c962e91a757c67fe9ddd3226e40/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1767993599","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3908150/1b5c0793b9597c962e91a757c67fe9ddd3226e40/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1767993599","categories":[{"description":"Keyboard Only Option","id":75},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Includes level editor","id":17}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"When creating a character, it is possible to see them in their underwear"},"demos":[{"appid":4232980,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Create your Visual Novel</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>NovelStudio</strong> is an all-in-one editor designed to bring your interactive stories to life. No technical skills required. Whether you're a writer, game designer, or simply passionate about storytelling, become a Visual Novel producer. Characters, backgrounds, dialogues, mechanics. Everything you need to express your creativity is included.\u00a0\u00a0<br><br>\u00a0 \u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Customizable 2D animated characters\u00a0\u00a0</strong>\u00a0\u00a0<br>Create your own characters in just a few clicks with a variety of facial expressions, outfits, and poses. You can also import your own artwork or custom 3D models.<br>\u00a0 \u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Design your own backgrounds\u00a0\u00a0</strong>\u00a0<br>Easily craft classic visual novel settings or import your own images for a more personal visual style.<br>\u00a0 \u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Build your story without coding\u00a0\u00a0</strong>\u00a0<br>Create your story\u2019s structure using an intuitive system of narrative blocks. Each block contains a scene with backgrounds, characters, dialogue, interactive choices, and audio files.<br>\u00a0 \u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Add gameplay and depth\u00a0\u00a0</strong>\u00a0<br>Use variables to create gauges, manage money, track relationships, or influence the story. Add modifiers to build complex systems, all without writing a single line of code. <br>\u00a0 \u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Create playable levels\u00a0\u00a0</strong>\u00a0<br>With its built-in 3D map editor, Novel Studio even lets you design interactive environments with playable characters and ready-to-use assets.</p>","developers":["CodeurDeNuit"],"genres":[{"description":"Design & Illustration","id":"53"},{"description":"Game Development","id":"60"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3908150/1b7d9beb251a16639a8f839373652b44954441ae/header.jpg?t=1767993599","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"Novel Studio","linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong>  Ubuntu 22.04<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i3 10100 / Ryzen 3 4100<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> (OpenGL ES 3.0)  NVIDIA GTX 2060/Radeon HD 7000<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 3 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> 1920x1080</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 3 GB available space</li></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3908150/1235419612/b2ef409244aaa0caacb2eb46e29a5708ce47ff51/1766068260/dash_av1.mpd?t=1766068542","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3908150/1235419612/b2ef409244aaa0caacb2eb46e29a5708ce47ff51/1766